      "raw_full_hex": "0E0000000200020096000E00010004000000A100410079007900790021000E0003000000020028000E0000000200020064000000"
    },
    "28": {
      "text": "¡Sin las alas, la corriente\nno funciona!<C:0003,0001,>",
